{"seq":2,"slug":"insurance-claim-payout","title":"保险报案、定损与赔付","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/shipping-damage-freight-claims/cargo-insurance-claim/insurance-claim-payout","wordCount":2290,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"保险报案-定损与赔付\">保险报案、定损与赔付</h1><p>集装箱在目的港卸船时发现箱门一侧有约 40 厘米的凹陷，箱内靠门处的六托货物外箱挤压变形。此时距卸船还有 3 小时，收货人要在 3 小时内决定：是先拉走再报损，还是原地等待检验人。前一种做法省下三天堆存费，但失去了&quot;货物在承运人保管期间受损&quot;的现场；后一种做法多花三千美元，但把定损的主动权握在了自己手里。<strong>保险理赔的质量，很大程度取决于出险现场那几小时内做了什么决定。</strong></p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>货运险的出险流程与承运人索赔在结构上相似，但在三个关键点上不同：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>报案时限更短但更宽松的书面要求</strong>——保险条款通常要求&quot;及时&quot;通知，并允许口头先报、书面后补，这正是现场决策的缓冲空间；</li>\n<li><strong>定损由一个中立的第三方（检验人）主导</strong>——赔付金额不是双方协商的结果，而是检验报告推导出来的；</li>\n<li><strong>赔付之后索赔权转移给保险人</strong>——保险人取得代位追偿权，向承运人的索赔进入<a href=\"../carrier-freight-claim/freight-claim-workflow-doc\">承运商索赔</a>那套流程，但主体变成了保险公司。</li>\n</ol>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[出险] --&gt; B[立即通知保险人/代理]&#10;  B --&gt; C{损失是否显著}&#10;  C --&gt;|显著或争议| D[指派检验人 现场检验]&#10;  C --&gt;|轻微且单证充分| E[文件定损]&#10;  D --&gt; F[检验报告 定损与致损原因]&#10;  E --&gt; F&#10;  F --&gt; G[提交索赔单证]&#10;  G --&gt; H{保险人审核}&#10;  H --&gt;|认可| I[计算赔付额 扣免赔]&#10;  H --&gt;|争议| J[协商/公估/仲裁]&#10;  I --&gt; K[赔付到账]&#10;  K --&gt; L[保险人取得代位追偿权]&#10;  L --&gt; M[向承运人追偿]\">graph TD\n  A[出险] --&gt; B[立即通知保险人/代理]\n  B --&gt; C{损失是否显著}\n  C --&gt;|显著或争议| D[指派检验人 现场检验]\n  C --&gt;|轻微且单证充分| E[文件定损]\n  D --&gt; F[检验报告 定损与致损原因]\n  E --&gt; F\n  F --&gt; G[提交索赔单证]\n  G --&gt; H{保险人审核}\n  H --&gt;|认可| I[计算赔付额 扣免赔]\n  H --&gt;|争议| J[协商/公估/仲裁]\n  I --&gt; K[赔付到账]\n  K --&gt; L[保险人取得代位追偿权]\n  L --&gt; M[向承运人追偿]</pre><h3 id=\"现场决策的三条规则\">现场决策的三条规则</h3><p>出险现场的决定会锁定后续几个月的谈判空间。有三条规则应当被写进操作 SOP，而不是靠现场判断：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>在发现异常的第一时间通知保险人</strong>，即使损失金额尚未确定。通知本身不产生费用，不通知却可能丧失索赔资格；</li>\n<li><strong>不要移动、不要处置受损货物</strong>，除非移动是为了防止损失扩大（如遇水货物需转移，但转移过程要留证）。处置受损货物前必须取得保险人的书面同意，否则可能被认定为放弃残值；</li>\n<li><strong>在承运人交付时要求其在交付凭证上批注</strong>异常状况并签字。这份批注是向承运人追偿的核心证据，一旦签了&quot;外观完好&quot;，代位追偿的成功率会大幅下降。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>共同海损是一个需要单独识别的场景。</strong> 当承运人宣布共同海损时，货主会被要求提供共同海损担保（average guarantee）才能提货。此时应由保险人出具担保而非货主自掏现金，系统应把&quot;共同海损&quot;识别为一个独立案件类型并触发对应的担保流程，因为它涉及的不是单票损失，而是一次分摊。</p>\n<h3 id=\"报案时限与现场通知的先后\">报案时限与现场通知的先后</h3><p>保险条款通常要求&quot;及时&quot;通知并允许口头先报、书面后补，但这不等于可以推迟通知。与承运人侧一样，通知义务在部分法域下是有明确日数的：蒙特利尔公约体系下，货物损坏的书面异议须在<strong>收到货物后 7 日内</strong>提出、延误须在<strong>21 日内</strong>提出（<a href=\"https://www.legislation.gov.uk/ukpga/2002/39/schedule/1/data.xht\">公约第 31 条第 2 款，英国 2002 年航空运输法附表 1</a>）。<strong>这条日数约束反过来决定了出险现场的动作顺序</strong>：先通知（哪怕只是口头或一封邮件），再谈处置与检验。任何&quot;先把货拉走、之后再报&quot;的做法都在同时消耗两个时限。</p>\n<h2 id=\"定损的方法与争议点\">定损的方法与争议点</h2><p>定损是把&quot;货坏了&quot;变成&quot;损失 4,120 美元&quot;的过程。方法的选择会显著影响结果，且不同方法在条款下的适用性不同。</p>\n<h3 id=\"五类定损方法\">五类定损方法</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>定损方法</th>\n<th>适用情形</th>\n<th>计算基础</th>\n<th>争议点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>修复法</td>\n<td>货物可修复</td>\n<td>修理费 + 往返运费</td>\n<td>修理后是否贬值未计入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>减值法</td>\n<td>受损但可用</td>\n<td>完好价 − 受损后价</td>\n<td>受损后价的取值随意</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>重置法</td>\n<td>全损且可重购</td>\n<td>目的地重置成本</td>\n<td>是否含关税与运费</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>残值法</td>\n<td>全损但有残值</td>\n<td>保险价值 − 残值拍卖所得</td>\n<td>残值处置是否经保险人同意</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分摊法</td>\n<td>部分损失</td>\n<td>按受损比例分摊保险价值</td>\n<td>比例基数的确定</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>在货运险下，赔付的默认基准是目的地价值（destination value），而不是发票价。</strong> 这意味着货值本身之外，已付运费与保险费，以及在部分条款下的关税，都可能构成赔付基础的一部分——它们的口径必须与承运人索赔侧保持一致，避免同一项成本被两个渠道重复主张，具体拆分见 <a href=\"../claim-insight-prevention/claim-amount-calc\">赔付金额计算与币种</a>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"检验人的指派与报告质量\">检验人的指派与报告质量</h3><p>检验人是定损的核心角色，通常由保险人指派或双方共同指定。检验报告的质量直接决定赔付的可争议空间。一份可用的检验报告应至少包含：<strong>检验时间与地点、货物状态描述与影像、致损原因的判断（并说明依据）、损失的量化方法与结论、以及检验人资质</strong>。缺了&quot;致损原因判断依据&quot;的一栏，实际上等于放弃了向承运人代位追偿的基础——因为保险人赔付后要向承运人追偿，必须证明损失原因落在承运人责任范围内。</p>\n<h3 id=\"定损方法的选择依据\">定损方法的选择依据</h3><p>方法选择不是任意的，它由三个条件共同决定：<strong>货物是否可修复</strong>（决定修复法与重置法之争）、<strong>市场是否存在该货物的有效价格</strong>（决定减值法是否可用）、<strong>残值是否有可处置的渠道</strong>（决定残值法是否成立）。当三个条件都不满足时（例如定制件、无二手市场、残值无买家），定损退化为协商，此时检验报告中的&quot;损失量化方法与结论&quot;就是协商的锚点，其表述的确定性直接影响结果。</p>\n<h3 id=\"部分损失的分摊基数\">部分损失的分摊基数</h3><p>部分损失下按比例分摊时，分摊基数的选择会产生系统性差异：以<strong>数量</strong>为基数（受损件数/总件数）与以<strong>价值</strong>为基数（受损件值/总货值）在同一批货里可能相差很大，尤其是受损的恰好是高价值 SKU 时。保单条款通常约定以价值为基数，但这需要显式确认而不是默认。</p>\n<h2 id=\"赔付计算\">赔付计算</h2><p>赔付额的计算顺序有严格的先后，顺序错了结果会差很多。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>e</mi></msub></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>×</mo><mi>L</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P = \\min\\left(\\frac{V_i}{V_e}, 1\\right) \\times L - D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span> 为赔付额，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为投保金额，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>e</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_e</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为保险价值（约定的价值基准，通常为 CIF 价加约定成数），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 为认定的损失金额，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 为免赔额。比例项 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\min(V_i/V_e, 1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 就是保额不足时的比例分摊，见 <a href=\"cargo-insurance-policy\">货运保险投保与承保范围</a>。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 赔付计算可复算，保留全部输入以便复核&#10;CREATE TABLE insurance_settlement (&#10;  settlement_id   BIGSERIAL PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  claim_id        BIGINT      NOT NULL,&#10;  policy_id       TEXT        NOT NULL,&#10;  insured_value   NUMERIC(14,2) NOT NULL,&#10;  sum_insured     NUMERIC(14,2) NOT NULL,&#10;  loss_assessed   NUMERIC(14,2) NOT NULL,&#10;  deductible      NUMERIC(14,2) NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,&#10;  deductible_type TEXT        NOT NULL,  -- per_shipment|per_occurrence|franchise&#10;  coinsurance_pct NUMERIC(6,4) NOT NULL DEFAULT 1.0,&#10;  payable_amount  NUMERIC(14,2) NOT NULL,&#10;  currency        CHAR(3)     NOT NULL,&#10;  surveyor_report TEXT,&#10;  computed_at     TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT now(),&#10;  CHECK (payable_amount &gt;= 0)&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 赔付计算可复算，保留全部输入以便复核</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> insurance_settlement</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  settlement_id   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGSERIAL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  claim_id        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  policy_id       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  insured_value   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">14</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  sum_insured     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">14</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  loss_assessed   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">14</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  deductible      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">14</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  deductible_type </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- per_shipment|per_occurrence|franchise</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  coinsurance_pct </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">6</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  payable_amount  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">14</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  currency        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  surveyor_report </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  computed_at     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (payable_amount </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>deductible_type</code> 必须区分三种语义，它们在数学上不同：<strong>每票免赔</strong>（每票扣一次）、<strong>每次事故免赔</strong>（一次事故含多票只扣一次）、<strong>起赔额（franchise）</strong>（损失超过阈值才赔，且一旦超过通常全额赔而不扣减）。第三种最容易被错误地当成前两种处理——把 franchise 当 deductible 会少赔一整笔免赔额。</p>\n<h3 id=\"代位追偿的衔接\">代位追偿的衔接</h3><p>保险人赔付之后自动取得代位追偿权，此时向承运人的索赔主体变为保险人。系统上需要在两处衔接：<strong>赔付完成时生成代位追偿凭证</strong>（含赔付金额、损失原因、致损责任段判定），以及<strong>把承运人索赔的权利让与链更新为保险人</strong>。要注意同一损失在两处的可主张金额不能叠加：承运人赔付的部分会在保险人侧被扣除，反之亦然——防止重复获赔是这一处的核心约束，见 <a href=\"../carrier-freight-claim/carrier-claim-recover-rate\">承运商索赔成功率与回款</a> 中的防呆设计。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>出险现场的三条规则决定后续谈判空间：<strong>第一时间通知、不擅自移动或处置受损货物、要求承运人在交付凭证上批注异常</strong>。</li>\n<li>共同海损是需要单独识别的案件类型，应由保险人出具担保而非货主自掏现金。</li>\n<li>定损方法有修复/减值/重置/残值/分摊五类，各有不同的争议点；货运险的默认赔付基准是<strong>目的地价值</strong>而非发票价。</li>\n<li>检验报告必须包含致损原因判断及其依据，否则代位追偿失去基础。</li>\n<li>赔付额按 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><mi>L</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P = \\min(V_i/V_e, 1) \\times L - D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 计算；<strong>免赔额的三种语义（每票/每次事故/起赔额）在数学上不同</strong>，起赔额被误当作免赔额会少赔一整笔。</li>\n<li>赔付完成即触发代位追偿，索赔主体变为保险人；同一损失在保险与承运人两处的可主张金额不得叠加。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>赔付金额确定之后，还有一类损失是无论金额大小都拿不到的——它们从条款上就被排除了。这属于 <a href=\"deductible-exclusion-handle\">免赔额与除外责任</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"保险报案、定损与赔付","id":"保险报案-定损与赔付"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":3,"text":"现场决策的三条规则","id":"现场决策的三条规则"},{"level":3,"text":"报案时限与现场通知的先后","id":"报案时限与现场通知的先后"},{"level":2,"text":"定损的方法与争议点","id":"定损的方法与争议点"},{"level":3,"text":"五类定损方法","id":"五类定损方法"},{"level":3,"text":"检验人的指派与报告质量","id":"检验人的指派与报告质量"},{"level":3,"text":"定损方法的选择依据","id":"定损方法的选择依据"},{"level":3,"text":"部分损失的分摊基数","id":"部分损失的分摊基数"},{"level":2,"text":"赔付计算","id":"赔付计算"},{"level":3,"text":"代位追偿的衔接","id":"代位追偿的衔接"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"货运保险投保与承保范围","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/shipping-damage-freight-claims/cargo-insurance-claim/cargo-insurance-policy"},"next":{"title":"免赔额与除外责任的处理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/shipping-damage-freight-claims/cargo-insurance-claim/deductible-exclusion-handle"}}